<title>SPAIN: Spain February producer prices rose 0.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Spain February producer prices rose 0.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Institute gave the following figures:</p>
<p> PRODUCER PRICES		    FEB 97     JAN 97     FEB 96</p>
<p> Pct change on month		-0.1	  -0.1	  0.3</p>
<p> Pct change on year		  0.5	   0.8	  2.7</p>
</text>
